    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Even if we may never meet again, you&apos;re still the one I long to see most… Eight stories of love and longing—of wanting to meet but being unable to, of wanting to love but being held back. Together, let us remember that final goodbye, and hold on to the hope that one day, we’ll smile and say to each other: “See you tomorrow”</marc:subfield>
